Name=WaveToAmiga
GenericName=WAV to Amiga sound converter
GenericName[de]=WAV-zu-Amiga-Sound-Konverter
Comment=Convert WAV files to Amiga sound formats (8SVX, AIFF, 16SV, MAUD)
